<title>MEXICO: Cemex 6 mos. net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Cemex 6 mos. net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		    6-mos 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  2.589 bln		5.096 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		 13.839 bln	     13.979 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     5.343 bln		5.525 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	3.253 bln		3.476 bln</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   536.13 million     gain  3.103 bln</p>
<p>	    Int paid    2.002 bln		n.a.</p>
<p>	    FX loss     49.41 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    Int earned  122.71 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    2.465 bln		n.a.</p>
<p>	    NOTE: The company added that its earnings per share</p>
<p>during the second quarter was 1.98 pesos. All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Cemex SA.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
